    "detailed_description": "Utilize a huge number of moves to destroy your enemies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852850/extras/Moves.GIF?t=1727738165\" /></span> <br><br>Push enemies into each other and off the board.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852850/extras/4976a7ba8190afebc4a64a031d7c08d0.poster.avif?t=1727738165\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852850/extras/4976a7ba8190afebc4a64a031d7c08d0.webm?t=1727738165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852850/extras/4976a7ba8190afebc4a64a031d7c08d0.mp4?t=1727738165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br><br>Save unused \u2018Action Points\u2019 to unleash devastating \u2018System\u2019 moves.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852850/extras/217a942a834aab81baa407ffa0bd771f.poster.avif?t=1727738165\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852850/extras/217a942a834aab81baa407ffa0bd771f.webm?t=1727738165\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852850/extras/217a942a834aab81baa407ffa0bd771f.mp4?t=1727738165\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unlock the core to set up your own procedurally generated maps for endless replayability.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2852850/extras/97806a6a84cce14d07fd4a7dd2be8cf4.poster.avif?t=172773